# Legend (values are averaged over each summary window)
# ep: end episode of the window.
# win: window start-end episodes.
# count: episodes in the window.
# avg_reward/avg_steps/avg_ticks/avg_births/avg_deaths: mean episode metrics.
# rps/rpt: reward per step / reward per tick.
# eps_pm: episodes per minute in the summary window.
# lr: optimizer learning rate at log time.
# diff: curriculum difficulty factor (0..1).
# tick/pop: last tick and population seen in the window.
# thr: compact throughput diagnostics (env step + IPC + PPO update latency, ms).
# stock[min|avg]: min/mean stockpile ratio across resources.
# crit/idle/pop_bal: avg critical needs, idle adults, and population balance.
# raid: avg raid count/deaths/loot/exposure/defense in the window.
# short: average shortage per resource (1 - stockpile ratio).
# under: average Underrealm combat/progression signal bundle (depth/champion/readiness/pressure).
# term: termination reason mix within the window.
# scenario_target_mix: target distribution based on base weights.
# weather/scenario: top label and share in the window.
# scenario_delta: L1/2 distance between target mix and window mix.
# events: notable triggers (best_eval, eval_regression, scenario_shift).
